#: 786a12cf460b4b6ab5a65e68cb53987f
msgid "The remaining 6 outputs (labelled AUX1 to AUX6) are the \"auxiliary\" outputs. These are directly attached to the STM32F427 and support all PWM protocols as well as DShot."
